{"id":"665079","name":"剁椒大骨","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/665079/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"大骨","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜头","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"大骨冷水下锅焯烫出血水后洗净。","img":"images/665079/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"洗净的大骨放入高压锅中。","img":"images/665079/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/665079/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"高压锅大火压20分钟左右。","img":"images/665079/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"压好的捞出晾凉。","img":"images/665079/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"蒜头拍扁剁碎。","img":"images/665079/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅中热油炒香蒜末。","img":"images/665079/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入剁椒酱炒匀。","img":"images/665079/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"适量蚝油白糖调味。","img":"images/665079/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入适量清水，大火煮开。","img":"images/665079/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入大骨。","img":"images/665079/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"盖上中小火焖5分钟左右即可。","img":"images/665079/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/665079/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/665079/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/665079/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：高压锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}